  "description": "The native payload for Agora's video quality analysis extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_macOS 4.7.0 archive and packaged for .NET for macOS. Scores the outgoing video's perceptual quality so the engine can trade resolution against frame rate on the evidence rather than on bitrate alone. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Mac or Net.Agora.Voice.Mac — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is enabled by the engine itself once present in the RTC binding.",
